ps.vim/pull/153|#153 :bug: Use `globpath` to properly handle `runtimepath`\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/pull/153|#153 :bug: Use `globpath` to properly handle `runtimepath`\u003e","text":"Close #152","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim|vim-denops/denops.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1634353013}],"reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tada","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U02HJ44V1CN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VDgU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c5393c0-7539-45bf-938b-7ee81a9667f0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"dein.vimはglobパターン使ってないからでは？Shougoさん自身知らなかったと言ってたし","ts":"1634352735.039800","thread_ts":"1634352735.039800","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KJjvj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"375506b4-8df3-440b-8fbd-a54fadb1d71d","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"packpath使わずにdeinでrtpをマージしてると動く、というのがちょっと分からない\npackpathの評価にglobが使われてる？","ts":"1634352514.039000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3=Mkj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a4f795b4-39a7-47e8-a526-43f473a7b630","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"たぶんそう","ts":"1634352479.038500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pqi7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c712035b-3931-4b54-8909-c74b372fadbb","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"FA?","ts":"1634352387.037800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mr+U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db5c6d7b-2fe3-4bc5-9e38-98fc3ea7305d","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"1. もともと `rtp` に `*` とかが認められていた\n2. そんなの使う人が居なかったから今まで動いていた\n3. Neovim 使うようになったから動かなくなった","ts":"1634352375.037600","thread_ts":"1634352375.037600","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PK8KE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60f7d2a0-eec3-4f4b-be97-c871a8c09c38","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ここ直せばいいのかな\n\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/blob/5611e37e734f94db8504be21657bc131658f25a2/autoload/denops/plugin.vim#L61-L72\u003e","ts":"1634352369.037300","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/blob/5611e37e734f94db8504be21657bc131658f25a2/autoload/denops/plugin.vim | plugin.vim\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/blob/5611e37e734f94db8504be21657bc131658f25a2/autoload/denops/plugin.vim | plugin.vim\u003e","text":"```\nfunction! s:gather_plugins(plugins) abort\n  for runtimepath in split(\u0026amp;runtimepath, ',')\n    let expr = denops#util#join_path(expand(runtimepath), 'denops', '*', 'main.ts')\n    for script in glob(expr, 1, 1, 1)\n      let plugin = fnamemodify(script, ':h:t')\n      if plugin[:0] ==# '@' || has_key(a:plugins, plugin)\n        continue\n      endif\n      call extend(a:plugins, { plugin : script })\n    endfor\n  endfor\nendfunction\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim|vim-denops/denops.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZYIN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9e49680-7745-4339-807a-cceecf8d2822","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"こっちには載ってないな","ts":"1634352352.036700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qxx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0616cc9-f118-4bba-8761-c1468988479a","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"あ、なるほど？","ts":"1634352337.035900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VjroH"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                *'runtimepath'* *'rtp'* *vimfiles*\n'runtimepath' 'rtp'     文字列  (既定値:\n                                        Unix:  \"$HOME/.vim,\n                                                $VIM/vimfiles,\n                                                $VIMRUNTIME,\n                                                $VIM/vimfiles/after,\n                                                $HOME/.vim/after\"\n                                        Amiga: \"home:vimfiles,\n                                                $VIM/vimfiles,\n                                                $VIMRUNTIME,\n                                                $VIM/vimfiles/after,\n                                                home:vimfiles/after\"\n                                        MS-Windows: \"$HOME/vimfiles,\n                                                $VIM/vimfiles,\n                                                $VIMRUNTIME,\n                                                $VIM/vimfiles/after,\n                                                $HOME/vimfiles/after\"\n                                        macOS: \"$VIM:vimfiles,\n                                                $VIMRUNTIME,\n                                                $VIM:vimfiles:after\"\n                                        Haiku: \"$BE_USER_SETTINGS/vim,\n                                                $VIM/vimfiles,\n                                                $VIMRUNTIME,\n                                                $VIM/vimfiles/after,\n                                                $BE_USER_SETTINGS/vim/after\"\n                                        VMS:   \"sys$login:vimfiles,\n                                                $VIM/vimfiles,\n                                                $VIMRUNTIME,\n                                                $VIM/vimfiles/after,\n                                                sys$login:vimfiles/after\")\n                        グローバル\n        以下のランタイムファイルが検索されるディレクトリのリスト。\n          filetype.vim  ファイル名によるファイルタイプの決定 |new-filetype|\n          scripts.vim   ファイルの内容によるファイルタイプの決定\n                        |new-filetype-scripts|\n          autoload/     自動的に読み込まれるスクリプト |autoload-functions|\n          colors/       色テーマ定義ファイル |:colorscheme|\n          compiler/     コンパイラ定義ファイル |:compiler|\n          doc/          ヘルプドキュメント |write-local-help|\n          ftplugin/     ファイルタイププラグイン |write-filetype-plugin|\n          import/       `:import` によって探されるファイル\n          indent/       インデントスクリプト |indent-expression|\n          keymap/       キーマップ定義ファイル |mbyte-keymap|\n          lang/         翻訳版メニュー |:menutrans|\n          menu.vim      GUI版メニュー |menu.vim|\n          pack/         パッケージ |:packadd|\n          plugin/       プラグインスクリプト |write-plugin|\n          print/        印刷用のファイル |postscript-print-encoding|\n          spell/        スペルチェック用のファイル |spell|\n          syntax/       文法ファイル |mysyntaxfile|\n          tutor/        Vimtutor用ファイル |tutor|\n \n        および、コマンド |:runtime| で検索される全てのファイル。\n \n        ほとんどのシステムでの既定値は、以下の5カ所を検索するようになっている。\n        1. ユーザーの個人的な設定を読み込むため、ユーザーのホームディレクトリ\n           を検索する。\n        2. システム管理者による設定を読み込むため、システム共通のVim用ディレク\n           トリを検索する。\n        3. Vim付属のファイルを読み込むため、環境変数 $VIMRUNTIME 内を検索する。\n```","ts":"1634352216.035600","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"de6c696d-657c-4a5f-bcfe-79d0f811e40f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h 'runtimepath'","ts":"1634352215.035500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YAJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"934d53cf-41b9-4b60-9771-6c0d137027c3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"rtpにglob突っ込めるらしく、Neovimがそ