,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a5wX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"26b0414f-32fd-43fa-8055-99eb8f725e9f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"pacmanのリポジトリに1.15.0が入りやがったのでそれでかな","ts":"1634351433.025100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dNdO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"130d8d28-c5bf-4f31-a96d-e47c87712630","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Deno1.15.0のバグのやつですね、ダウングレードするか自力でDeno用意してねと回答するといいと思います","ts":"1634351215.024400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["U776661HA","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+aT1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3d70ef0-b14d-4245-af93-82c9ed00f72a","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/issues/151\u003e\n\nこれ何かわかる人います？","ts":"1634350961.023200","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/issues/151|#151 Failed to connect denops server\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/issues/151|#151 Failed to connect denops server\u003e","text":"After a recent system update (Arch Linux) I see the following error when starting nvim with \u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/dein.vim|dein\u003e (sorry, I'm not sure if this error is on the denops or dein side)\n\n\u0026gt; [denops] error: Uncaught ReferenceError: charset is not defined  \n\u0026gt; [denops] [charset.QUOTATION_MARK]: charset.QUOTATION_MARK,  \n\u0026gt; [denops] ^  \n\u0026gt; [denops] at \u003chttps://deno.land/x/streamparser_json@v0.0.5/utils/utf-8.ts:105:4|https://deno.land/x/streamparser_json@v0.0.5/utils/utf-8.ts:105:4\u003e  \n\u0026gt; [denops] Failed to connect denops server: Vim(let):connection failed: tcp address must be host:port\n\nHere are relevant versions that I can think of\n\n\u0026gt; $ nvim -ver  \n\u0026gt; NVIM v0.5.1  \n\u0026gt; Build type: Release  \n\u0026gt; LuaJIT 2.0.5\n\n\u0026gt; $ deno --version  \n\u0026gt; deno 1.15.0 (release, x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu)  \n\u0026gt; v8 9.5.172.19  \n\u0026gt; typescript 4.4.2\n\nAnd here is a minimal `init.vim`. When I completely clear out my dein cache and then start nvim with this file, it will install denops and after a few seconds give the above error\n\n```\n\" .#vimrc\n\n\" Required:\nset runtimepath+=/home/ryantr/.cache/dein/repos/github.com/Shougo/dein.vim\ncall dein#begin('/home/ryantr/.cache/dein')\ncall dein#add('/home/ryantr/cache/dein/repos/github.com/Shougo/dein.vim')\ncall dein#add('vim-denops/denops.vim')\ncall dein#end()\n\nif dein#check_install()\n  call dein#install()\nendif\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim|vim-denops/denops.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1634311809}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DMq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20dda0de-cbdf-4a93-aacb-cb07afc62d18","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ありがとうございます\n後で試してみます","ts":"1634371469.050200","thread_ts":"1634353095.041600","parent_user_id":"U776661HA","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h3Am"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b66834f9-8545-4c78-94df-e0933f290457","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"そうです","ts":"1634354726.047700","thread_ts":"1634352735.039800","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desuyone","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bJc2j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a813e16-0318-42e4-8576-0e95cccaa1cd","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"イエス","ts":"1634354708.047500","thread_ts":"1634352375.037600","parent_user_id":"U776661HA","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_orig